@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Admin" as User
boundary "Halaman Laporan" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Reports" as DB

== Laporan Pelanggan ==

User -> UI : Pilih tipe laporan\n& filter periode
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/reports/customers
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Query data pelanggan,\nlangganan, & invoice
activate DB
DB --> System : Raw data
deactivate DB

System -> System : Agregasi data\n(status aktif, total bayar)
System -> DB : Join dengan\nbandwidth_profile & router
activate DB
DB --> System : Data tergabung
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data & statistik
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> User : Tampilkan tabel\n& ringkasan statistik
deactivate UI

== Laporan Penjualan Hotspot ==

User -> UI : Pilih periode &\nfilter router/paket
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/reports/hotspot
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Query data penjualan\nvoucher & profil
activate DB
DB --> System : Data penjualan
deactivate DB

System -> System : Agregasi\n(pendapatan, kuantitas, profit)
System -> System : Generate data grafik\n(tren & paket terlaris)

System --> UI : Data tabel & grafik
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> User : Tampilkan dashboard\npenjualan & grafik
deactivate UI

== Export & Download Laporan ==

User -> UI : Klik Export (PDF/Excel)
activate UI
UI -> System : POST /api/reports/export
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil dataset
activate DB
DB --> System : Data lengkap
deactivate DB

System -> System : Render template laporan\n(PDF/Excel)
System -> System : Tambahkan metadata\n(tanggal, admin)
System -> DB : Catat log export\n(audit trail)
activate DB
DB --> System : Log tersimpan
deactivate DB

System --> UI : File / download URL
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> User : Download file ke perangkat
deactivate UI

note right of User
  Laporan pelanggan: status & bayar.
  Laporan penjualan: hotspot & tren.
  Export: PDF & Excel.
  Audit log setiap export.
end note

@enduml